    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a1">

                <pb facs="0885" n="815" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg815"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caracas,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 26, 1867,</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#right">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Fourth year of the Law and ninth of the Federation.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The minister of foreign relations of the United States of Venezuela salutes,
                    courteously, the minister resident of the United States, and informs him that
                    the great citizen marshal president will receive at the Government House on
                    Sunday, the 28th, at 11 a. m., to which day the celebration of the national
                    festival of the 19th, which fell on the holy week, has been transferred.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
